{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Music Metadata Database","anchor":"Music-Metadata-Database","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In the Caches Directory, AutomixIQ keeps a light weight sql database to store the metadata of tracks that have been played for subsequent lookup. This file is called “music.db” and if deleted will be recreated on launch."}]},{"text":"Music Analysis Database","anchor":"Music-Analysis-Database","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In the Caches Directory, AutomixIQ keeps a light weight sql database to store the analysis data of tracks that have been played for subsequent lookup. This analysis is required to produce beat-matched transitions. This file is called “paralysis.db” and if deleted will be recreated on launch."}]},{"text":"Playback Log","anchor":"Playback-Log","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"AutomixIQ stores offline playback logs for subsequent reporting on a Core Data database, modelled by the following classes:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.cocoapods.SocialRadio\/documentation\/SocialRadio\/AutomixIQPlayLog","type":"reference","isActive":true}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.cocoapods.SocialRadio\/documentation\/SocialRadio\/AutomixIQPlayLogAttributes","type":"reference","isActive":true}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.cocoapods.SocialRadio\/documentation\/SocialRadio\/AutomixIQPlayLogID","type":"reference","isActive":true}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"text":"Transition Playback Log","anchor":"Transition-Playback-Log","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"AutomixIQ stores offline transition playback logs for subsequent reporting on a Core D